        <h1>Online Etiquette: How to Talk to Strangers the Right Way</h1>

        <div class="blog-post-meta">
          <span>20 June, 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>12 min read</span>
        </div>

        <img
          src={pic2.src}
